  "goodToKnow": "Der Weltkrieg is a world war: der Erste Weltkrieg (1914–1918), der Zweite Weltkrieg (1939–1945). Germany's role in both wars shapes its culture of remembrance (Erinnerungskultur). Many German cities were rebuilt after the destruction of WWII. Kriegsdenkmäler (war memorials) are in every town."
